  "description": "Compiles the C# examples in a repository's Markdown (README, docs) from its own test project, so an example that no longer matches the library fails a test. Reads csharp/cs/c# fences (including inside blockquotes), assembles each as a top-level program with the repository's usings and stand-in declarations, compiles it with Roslyn, and checks a roster of deliberate fragments. A separate package from Iyu.Conventions.Testing because it depends on Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp.",
